   declared sizes compound under .post-content and can land below the 11px floor. */
.post-content .rc-a-src code{font-family:var(--rca-mono);
  font-size:12.5px;background:#f5f5f0;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;
  /* The site-wide code style is written for dark blocks and leaves inline code
     white; on this cream chip that measured 1.09:1 — pin the ink colour too.
     The pin stays OFF the pre block below, whose site-supplied background is
     dark and whose site-supplied ink is light; pinning both there measured
     1.16:1. Scope narrowly and let the block keep the theme's pairing. */
  color:var(--rca-t1)}
